  m_text: 'Day 1:

    Prota was a lie, it''s just nothingness. Was this the kingdom
    I was promised? I need to Keep Going to learn more


    Day 3:

    My intuition
    was Right. There is nothing in this plane, why?


    Day 4:

    What is there
    left to do in this paradise? My legs are growing tired'
